  "description": "R-PAR-1 PAR-ERROR, SQL-DEMAND: Which error is reported for a row with two bad columns (id 80: zq = 0 and tq = 'x'): SELECT id, CLng(tq) AS a, 1 / zq AS b and the swapped column order, each with a read of a then b, b then a, and one GetRows(1); what do the Field reads give after the first error? Runs on a fresh copy of r-par-1-error opened read-only through DAO OpenDatabase in one process and one STA; each statement is opened with Database.OpenRecordset as a snapshot unless stated, and every call's result, HRESULT and DBEngine.Errors are captured.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
